  "build_mechanic": "Balanced low-input Frog Storm Cloud build. Mini Ballista + Ahmad + Flux form the Lightning-triggered Storm Cloud engine; Thunder's Earring supplies another automatic Lightning source. Benchmark with movement and Guard only; no Normal/Special attacks.",
  "notes": "OPTIMIZED: Companion 10/10 and Storm Cloud 10/10 exactly. Removed Devotion Insignia, Tero’s Spirit Powder, Sapote Fruit, and Sharp Acorn. Added Thunder's Earring, Resonance Stone, Beast's Heart, and Academy Brigandine. This preserves 26 Artifact + 7 Tablet / 33 slots, reaches Magitech 4/4, and adds automatic Lightning damage, Highest Elemental Damage, Defense, Final Damage, and Academy/Guardian support without wasting Companion or Storm Cloud points. Artifact base levels remain Lv1; effective levels come only from Tablet placement.",
  "innate_skill": {
